# Capsule toys: one out of the machine (a picture pops up), the toys page, playing with one (do not
# disturb!), and the workbench's toy benches.
from after_tutorial
view full
tab machine
next-prize toy
pull 1 1.9
wait popup
click "lovely"

shot toy_popup
toy snail normal 4
toy acorn normal 1
toy bee ghost 1
toy gnome normal 1
toy ladybug holo 1
tab collection
click "toys"
wait 0.3
expect fits
shot toys
click "a quick play (10 min)"
wait 0.4
shot playing
boosts
click "workbench →"
wait 0.4
expect tab inventory
expect fits
shot bench
click "combine"
wait 0.3
shot combined
expect fits
